r senkrecht über dem Wasser hängt, weiter bis vor die Bucht unterhalb von Fossmork, dort wenden und zurück, den Preikestolen jetzt rechts, voraus der Blick fjordauswärts.", "en": "In the middle of the Lysefjord: heading north-east into the fjord between smooth granite walls, passing beneath Preikestolen, the rock pulpit that juts out 604 metres straight above the water, on to just short of the bay below Fossmork, then turn and head back with Preikestolen on the right and the view out along the fjord ahead."}, "highlights": [{"name": {"de": "Preikestolen", "en": "Preikestolen (Pulpit Rock)"}, "side": "links", "note": {"de": "604 m über dem Fjord", "en": "604 m above the fjord"}}, {"name": {"de": "Granitwände des Lysefjords", "en": "Granite walls of the Lysefjord"}, "side": "rechts", "note": {"de": "bis gut 600 m hoch", "en": "rising to over 600 m"}}, {"name": {"de": "Fossmork", "en": "Fossmork"}, "side": "rechts", "note": {"de": "vor der Wende", "en": "before the turn"}}, {"name": {"de": "Blick fjordauswärts Richtung Forsand", "en": "View out towards Forsand"}, "side": "voraus", "note": {"de": "auf der Rückfahrt", "en": "on the way back"}}], "minimap": {"image": "minimap.jpg", "bounds_xz": [-1450.0, -1392.56, 1591.21, 1648.65]}, "overview": {"image": "overview.jpg", "bounds_xz": [-3882.97, -3825.53, 4024.18, 4081.62]}, "traffic": {"vessels": ["kursschiff", "motorboot", "faehre"], "density": 0.7, "rower_lanes": [{"out_m": -9.0, "back_m": 22.0, "turn_out_m": -16.0, "turn_back_m": 28.0}, {"out_m": -18.0, "back_m": 31.0, "turn_out_m": -24.0, "turn_back_m": 36.0}, {"out_m": -27.0, "back_m": 40.0, "turn_out_m": -32.0, "turn_back_m": 44.0}], "vessel_lanes": [{"id": "p-52-1", "kind": "parallel", "min_dist_m": 45.0, "shore_m": 380.1, "points_xz": [[-1641.5, 1409.6], [-331.7, 390.5], [-277.5, 350.5], [-213.2, 308.6], [660.8, -215.9], [738.7, -264.6], [1864.4, -1042.2]]}, {"id": "p65-2", "kind": "parallel", "min_dist_m": 46.0, "shore_m": 387.9, "points_xz": [[-1713.4, 1317.3], 